  _speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5b0efb9ebf8804f39a64eb09f5e67af0, type: 2}
  _lines:
  - Oh no... there will always be a new Manager.
  - I will always be able to find a more desperate Worker.
  - You always have something...
  - If not a girlfriend, or a child. A sick old parent, a debt, a felony.
  - A sin, a shame.
  - Something to fuel a Spirit.
  _options:
  - _optionText: ((... i don't think he understands human spirit...))
